    <GenerateDocumentationFile>false</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <PackageReadmeFile>COSMOS_SCENE_P0.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>Protect intake, cancellation and completion against journal failures. Persist completion and lease release before publication. Establish a durable lifetime recovery checkpoint before accepting work; preserve quarantine through ordinary writes and restarts. Explicit quiescence confirmation and clean shutdown are required to clear a failed checkpoint. Scene v1, jobs.json v1, known errors and official 0.1.3-dev1 dependencies remain unchanged. Do not downgrade with a checkpoint present. Real deployment acceptance is pending.</PackageReleaseNotes>
